Rauk Hammersfell~
A large dwarf begins swordplay with you upon entering the training chambers.
~
   Before you stands a burly dwarf dressed in light chainmail.  This is none
other than Rauk Hammersfell, current guildmaster of training for the Guild of
Warriors.  Rauk is a veteran of wars past and can teach you virtually any
weapon, from axe to polearm.  He is also able to school you in the special
combat techniques warriors are known to use to win battles.    
~
